=== Combinations ===
Sum of odd numbers: 9

=== New Syntax Summary ===
pe (...)        -> for loop (ogni optional)
pure            -> AND (alias for 'e')
manco           -> NOT (alias for 'no')
!               -> direct NOT
avvis a di(...) -> console.warn
scrive a di(...)-> console.error
leva x.y        -> delete x.y
fermete         -> debugger
